        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Apartment 113, Bachelors Walk, Dublin 1\r\n\r\n€285,000 | 1 Bedroom | 1 Bathroom | 38 sq. m. | Designated Parking\r\n\r\nBartholomew McElhatton Estate Agents is delighted to present Apartment 113, Bachelors Walk, a one double bedroom apartment in an exceptionally convenient Dublin city centre location.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the second floor, the apartment extends to approximately 38 sq. m. and enjoys a pleasant outlook over the development’s internal garden. This quieter orientation provides a welcome sense of separation from the activity of the city outside.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a bright living and dining area, kitchen, double bedroom and bathroom. A designated parking space is included—an especially valuable feature in the heart of Dublin city centre.\r\n\r\nBachelors Walk enjoys an outstanding location overlooking the River Liffey and within a short walk of O’Connell Street, Trinity College, Temple Bar, Henry Street and Dublin’s principal business districts. The LUAS, DART, Dublin Bus services and numerous intercity transport connections are all readily accessible.\r\n\r\nThis property should appeal to first time buyers seeking a centrally located home, investors looking for a well positioned Dublin apartment, or buyers requiring a convenient city base.\r\n\r\nProperty Features\r\nSecond floor apartment\r\nApproximately 38 sq. m.\r\nOne double bedroom\r\nOne bathroom\r\nLiving and dining area\r\nInternal garden outlook\r\nDesignated parking space\r\nPrime Dublin 1 location\r\nExcellent public transport connections\r\nWalking distance of Dublin’s principal shopping, business and cultural districts\r\nAsking price: €285,000\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and is available by appointment through Bartholomew McElhatton Estate Agents."
